Maintainer: hako-os <hako@hako-os>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rg55g1-bsp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 linux-image-7.2.0-sm4450,
 hako-mesa,
 initramfs-tools,
 systemd,
 alsa-ucm-conf,
 alsa-utils
Conflicts: rpmini-bsp
Description: Anbernic RG 55G1 board support for hako
 Board support for the Anbernic RG 55G1 (Qualcomm SM4450 / Snapdragon G1 Gen 2)
 booted by OpenABL:
  - installs the kernel, initrd and DTBs to the FAT boot partition and
    writes the Boot Loader Specification entry (rg55g1-update-esp)
  - ALSA UCM profile for the speakers / headphones (from ROCKNIX)
  - USB-C device mode: CDC-NCM network (192.168.7.2) and CDC-ACM serial
  - session defaults for the portrait panel (/usr/lib/hako/session.d/10-rg55g1.sh),
    touch rotation (udev) and the volume keys without PipeWire
